! KPOLY removing the particles past coord_limit: the CPU's swap order of the lost rows, their z and
! momentum in the losses file, rebuilt on the host from the device's flags. Must be identical
Q1: QUAD, L=0.1, K1=0.5
D: DRIF, L=0.2
KX: KPOLY, COEFFICIENT=20, ORDER=2, PLANE="x", DX=2e-4, DZ=0.02
KY: KPOLY, COEFFICIENT=-30, ORDER=3, PLANE="y", TILT=0.3
BL: LINE=(Q1, D, KX, D, KY, D)
